Items.Ember_Rocket_Launcher.name = Ember Rocket Launcher
Items.Ember_Rocket_Launcher.description = Weaponbench MK4. Click to mark; click again to fire. Right-click clears the lock. Every rocket first flies 10 blocks straight ahead. 2-second firing interval. F: select ammunition.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Homing.name = Guided Rocket
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Homing.description = Marks a creature. 80 projectile explosion damage within 8 blocks.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Poison.name = Poison Bomb Rocket
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Poison.description = Marks a block. 30-second poison cloud, radius 8; creatures inside take 5 poison damage per second. No impact damage.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Napalm.name = Napalm Rocket
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Napalm.description = Marks a block. Bursts 10 blocks above it and rains fire in an 8-block radius. Ignites targets for 10 seconds at 6 fire damage per second. No impact damage.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Frost.name = Frost Bomb Rocket
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Frost.description = Marks a block. Freezes creatures within 8 blocks for 20 seconds, disabling movement. No damage.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Rainmaker.name = Silver Rainmaker Rocket
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Rainmaker.description = No lock needed: fires into the sky. Brings world-wide rain for 5 minutes; firing during rain brings lightning and thunder instead. Restores previous weather afterwards. No damage.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Nuclear.name = Nuclear Rocket
Items.Ember_Ammo_Rocket_Nuclear.description = Marks a block. Eliminates all living entities, including players and the shooter, within a 30-block radius and 30 blocks above ground, through cover. Mushroom cloud and shockwave. Server-configurable terrain destruction: none, vegetation, or a spherical crater up to 20 blocks deep.
